				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">ha, i can't believe raveena and kaldarye are still here! so how's cotw doing?
<br />

<br />
okay i got a notebook recently and have no need for a desktop, so im looking to sell it. might be a longshot to try it here, but might as well. sorry, might get flamed for posting this here :p
<br />

<br />
im looking for someone around the southern california area who is interested. if you're within a reasonable distance (25 miles or less) from orange county or the LAX airport, then i'd be more than happy to come by and drop off the computer (this ensures that i won't rip you off via paypal and we can also avoid shipping costs). if you're a computer illiterate, i can also install a fresh copy of windows/programs that you want.
<br />

<br />
here's the specs of the system:
<br />

<br />
- Abit NF7-S motherboard with a 2500+ Barton CPU (included is a seperate HSF that I bought from newegg)
<br />
- Geforce TI4200 8x AGP video card
<br />
- Seagate 160 Gigabyte hard drive
<br />
- Liteon 52x/32x/52x Cd-rw (plenty of room for expansion)
<br />
- 512 MB Kingston HyperX PC3200 (model KHX3200A)
<br />
- CoolerMaster Cavalier case (http://www.newegg.com/app/ViewProductDesc.asp?description=11-119-054&amp;depa=1) ... included is the 350 Watt Power Supply
<br />

<br />
Asking price for this base computer is $500 (i think it's a reasonable price.. or maybe it's not?)
<br />

<br />
I also have a few other accessories that i can include (if you pay me a bit more of course). Anyways, here is a list of the optional additions i can add:
<br />

<br />
- Altec Lansing 5.1 Speaker System
<br />
- Canon A60 Multifunction All-in-one printer (scanner, printer, photocopier)
<br />
- Logitech MX510 mouse
<br />
- 17" NEC monitor (not LCD, but it works fine for me at least)
<br />

<br />
I've easily gotten an FPS of 90 without changing any of the configs on wolfenstein with this setup. it usually hovers around 70ish though, depends on which area you are in the game.
<br />

<br />
you can also contact me at <a href="mailto:afobisme@yahoo.com">afobisme@yahoo.com</a>
<br />

<br />
oh and also... i've even got a 65 evil wiz gnome on sullon zek (evil). i've been playing eq on and off for the past 3 years (mostly off), and since i won't be need it anymore, im looking to sell that too. not looking for too much $, just something to compensate for the $$$ i put into buying the game/ldon/monthly fees. email me if you're interested. thanks.<div style="vertical-align: bottom"><br /><br /></div></span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
